Old Lady thought that it would be much safer to fetch new can of mushrooms from the cellar. But after a few seconds changed her mind because laziness prevailed and she was about to eat remaining milk mushrooms from the bowl. Old lady headed to the table but her old brain glitched because of such intensive mind work. She stopped halfway with her stretched out arms that were going to take the bowl. Sclerosis made fruitless all attempts to recollect where she was going and after a few curses old lady returned to bed.
Meanwhile Wolf came up to the house on the forest edge and knocked.
-Who is it? - sounded weak voice.
-It is me Red Hood, your granddaughter! -whispered Wolf making his voice as tender as he could.
-Ah, pull the string my dear and the door will open!
Once predator got inside he promptly swallowed granny, dressed up in her night gown, glasses, cap and lied to bed.	